        "introduce": "昆山致信天城电子材料有限公司成立于2013年，专业致力于无离型剂薄膜的研发与生产，公司薄膜产品广泛应用于电子制造业、复合材料等领域。针对复合材料之应用特点，公司研发的JL系列薄膜产品，可协助客户彻底解决离型剂污染带来的困扰，并减少生产工序，提升生产效率，有效降低客户生产成本。多年来，公司与日本三井株式会社及华东理工大学保持技术合作，目前已拥有多项技术发明专利，与国内外众多知名企业保持长期合作。\nKunshan Zhi Xin Tiancheng Electronic Materials Co., Ltd. was founded in 2013, specializing in the development and production of non-release agent film, film products are widely used in electronic manufacturing, composite materials and other fields. In view of the characteristics of composite materials, JL series thin film products developed by the company can help customers to thoroughly solve the problems caused by release agent pollution, and reduce production processes, improve production efficiency, effectively reduce customer production costs. Over the years, the company has maintained technical cooperation with Japan's Mitsui Co., Ltd. and East China University of Science and Technology, and many well-known enterprises at home and abroad to maintain long-term cooperation.",
